                                "sense_id": "e8ceb150-f23f-33da-ad05-09e1960a0b79",
                                "text": "You have in the merchant the shrewd calculator of probable contingencies; we shall see that we have in the prophet the absolute proclaimer of necessary and inevitable facts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db0a9c12-9a9e-449e-8be5-78e0c6e033cb",
                                "sense_id": "e8ceb150-f23f-33da-ad05-09e1960a0b79",
                                "text": "Though a herald and proclaimer of peace, he could fight stubbornly and passionately on the side of justice."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
